Hi Jeremy,

Amanda's May 12 pass missed four of the 14 important items on the selected R-226 route. I've attached the item-by-item order and an annotated view of where the path skipped. The ten items that were heard stayed in relative order; this is a result for one route and one continuous pass, not a claim about every route.

For the revision, could you check the selected route row first? Plan status needs to be heard with its value, Held, and Vehicle with its value, Van 16. Hearing a column name alone won't establish that its value is available. Then check the transition into detail: the Stops heading should be heard before stop 01. Finally, at stop 03, the Note “Call receiving before unloading” needs to be heard with the 03 identifier, before the path continues to stop 04. It was visible in the row but was not reached on Amanda's pass.

After the change, select R-226, return to the top of the page and follow the same continuous reading route through the four stops. Compare what you hear against the expected order and revision cues in CWR-SR-20250513-ORD-01 v1.0; the arrows and callouts in the image show the observed path and the four places to check. Please keep any reading obtained by pointing with the mouse separate from this pass.

Thanks,
Jennifer

